{"id":"word:hebrew:H5833","type":"word","title":"עֶזְרָה","subtitle":"H5833 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"aid","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to עֶזְרָה (H5833) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 26 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"עֶזְרָה (ʻezrâh) means aid First listed occurrence: 2Chr 28 21."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"עֶזְרָה","transliteration":"ʻezrâh","pronunciation":"ez-raw'","strong":"H5833","lemmaId":"hebrew:H5833","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["לְ/עֶזְרָ֔ה","לְ/עֶזְרָ֥תִ/י","עֶזְרָ֣תָ/ה","עֶזְרָתִ֣/י","עֶזְרָ֣ת"],"morphs":[["HR/Ncfsc/Sp1cs",6],["HR/Ncfsa",5],["HNcfsc/Sp1cs",4],["HNcfsc",3],["HR/Ncfsc",2],["HNcfsc/Sh",2],["HNcfsc/Sp1cp",1],["HR/Ncfsc/Sp2fs",1],["HNcfsa",1],["HNcfsa/Sh",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"aid","usage":"help(-ed, -er).","full":"H5833. ezrah or ezrath I. עֶזְרָ֫תָה עֶזְרָת, עֶזְרָה, noun feminine help, succour, assistance ; — absolute ׳ע Isa 10:3 +, עֶזְרָת Psalm 60:13; Psa 108:13 (Ges § 80g ), עֶזְרָ֫תָה 63:8 2 t.; construct עֶזְרַת Isa 31:2 +; suffix עֶזְרָתִי Psa 22:20 +, etc.; — 1 help, succour Isa 10:3 ; 20:6 (+ לְהִנָּצֵל ), 31:1 ; Jer 37:7 ; Lam 4:17 ; Job 6:13 ; 2Chr 28:21 ; ׳ע אָ֑וֶן מֹּעֲלֵי Isa 31:2 help from , etc.; ׳ע ׳י Judg 5:23 (twice in verse) help of (for) ׳י ; from ׳י Psa 22:20 ; Psalm 38:23; 40:14 (|| לְהַצִּילֵנִי ), 70:2 (|| id. ), 71:12 + מִצָּ֑ר Psalm 60:13 (|| תְּשׁוּעָה ) = 108:13 . 2 concrete, embodied help, one who helps (compare 1 עֵזֶר 2 ): a. collective Job 31:21 when I saw my help (assistance, support) in the gate; ׳בֵּע (see I. עֵזֶר 2 ) Nahum 3:9 . b. of ׳י Psa 27:9 ; Psalm 40:18 (+ מְפַלֵּט ), 46:2 (|| עֹז מַחֲסֶה, ) Psalm 44:27; 63:8 ; 94:17 ; ׳בְּע 35:2 .","rootNote":"or עֶזְרָת ; (Psalm 60:11 (13); Psalm 108:12 (13)), feminine of 5828 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstM